{"hw":"δοξόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">δοξόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δοξόω</span>, only <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δοξόομαι</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">have the character</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">credit</b> of being, <span class=\"gk\">ἐδοξώθη εἶναι σοφώτατος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.124</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δεδόξωσθε εἶναι ἀγαθοί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.135</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.48</span> </span>.</div></div>"}